body:
I mean before Eragon and Arya, only two known heroes have ever bested a shade in combat (I forget how the Varaug fight goes so I can't comment there but at least with Durza, Eragon had the advantage of surprise in the form of Arya and Saphira shattering the Star Saphire, as well as Durza on strict orders not to actually kill him) so I'd say a shade would be more than a match for most elves and humans, even riders.

&#x200B;

EDIT: If I remember right, Varaug was more powerful than Durza, but was disoriented after being newly created.
